From b98a1a6f6d17792eeff9305ba9c9121b0712550f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Navi48-MacOS contributors <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Thu, 1 Jan 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] darwin: host-pointer import (userptr) via N48N
 BoImportHost when the kernel ABI is >= 1.9; ABI header synced to 1.9

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
